<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Nexo | <%= pageTitle %></title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"></head>
<body class="page-editor"><%- include('partials/ambient') %><%- include('partials/header', { activePage: 'posts' }) %><main class="editor-shell"><aside class="editor-intro reveal"><a class="back-link" href="/posts">← REGRESAR</a><div class="signal"><i></i><span><%= post._id?'MODO EDICIÓN':'NUEVA HISTORIA' %></span><b>STUDIO</b></div><h1><%= post._id?'Dale una nueva forma.':'Haz visible tu idea.' %></h1><p>Construye una publicación que invite a detenerse, pensar y conversar.</p><div class="editor-object"><div class="mini-cube"><span>N</span></div><i></i><i></i><i></i><small>CREATIVE<br>SPACE</small></div></aside>
<section class="editor-panel reveal"><div class="panel-heading"><span><%= post._id?'EDITAR PUBLICACIÓN':'CREAR PUBLICACIÓN' %></span><b>01 — 04</b></div><form class="post-form" method="POST" action="<%= formAction %>"><% if(error){ %><div class="form-error" role="alert"><i>!</i><span><strong>Revisa la información</strong><%= error %></span></div><% } %>
<% if(!post._id){ %><label><span><b>01</b>Autor</span><select name="userId" required><option value="">Selecciona un usuario</option><% users.forEach(user=>{ %><option value="<%= user._id %>" <%= String(post.userId||'')===String(user._id)?'selected':'' %>><%= user.name %> <%= user.lastName||'' %></option><% }) %></select><small>La historia quedará asociada a este perfil.</small></label><% } %><label><span><b><%= post._id?'01':'02' %></b>Título</span><input name="title" value="<%= post.title||'' %>" minlength="5" maxlength="30" required placeholder="Una idea capaz de detener el scroll"><small>Entre 5 y 30 caracteres.</small></label><label><span><b><%= post._id?'02':'03' %></b>Contenido</span><textarea name="content" minlength="10" required placeholder="Cuéntalo con tu propia voz..."><%= post.content||'' %></textarea><small>Mínimo 10 caracteres.</small></label><div class="field-row"><label><span><b><%= post._id?'03':'04' %></b>Imagen <em>opcional</em></span><input type="url" name="imageUrl" value="<%= post.imageUrl||'' %>" placeholder="https://imagen.jpg"></label><label><span><b>＋</b>Hashtags <em>opcional</em></span><input name="hashtags" value="<%= Array.isArray(post.hashtags)?post.hashtags.join(', '):(post.hashtags||'') %>" placeholder="diseño, ideas"></label></div><div class="form-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/posts">Cancelar</a><button class="btn btn-glow magnetic" type="submit"><span><%= submitLabel %></span><b>→</b></button></div></form></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
